:"final_016_s0","report_id":"final_016","text":"Lab Report: Training dynamics of deep models","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s1","report_id":"final_016","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s2","report_id":"final_016","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.01 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s3","report_id":"final_016","text":"All experiments were run on a single GPU with 16 GB of memory.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s4","report_id":"final_016","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s5","report_id":"final_016","text":"EfficientNet reaches 72.2% accuracy at epoch 14.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s6","report_id":"final_016","text":"As shown in Figure 1, at epoch 10, DistilBERT is 15.3 points better than ResNet-18.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s7","report_id":"final_016","text":"Ours reaches 75.7% accuracy at epoch 6.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s8","report_id":"final_016","text":"From epoch 11 to epoch 12, the accuracy of CNN improves by a relative 40.1% (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s9","report_id":"final_016","text":"Figure 2 shows the test accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s10","report_id":"final_016","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 6, ResNet-50 achieves 63.5% test accuracy.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s11","report_id":"final_016","text":"At epoch 16, ResNet-50 achieves over 75% test accuracy.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s12","report_id":"final_016","text":"Figure 3 shows the f1 score during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s13","report_id":"final_016","text":"As shown in Figure 3, at epoch 16, MobileNet achieves over 85% F1 score.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s14","report_id":"final_016","text":"CNN attains a F1 score of 74.7% at epoch 26.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s15","report_id":"final_016","text":"As shown in Figure 3, at epoch 6, GRU is 19.3 points better than CNN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s16","report_id":"final_016","text":"Figure 4 shows the validation accuracy of GRU by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s17","report_id":"final_016","text":"GRU scores 6 points higher on IMDB than on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s18","report_id":"final_016","text":"GRU reaches 87.4% validation accuracy on SST-2 (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s19","report_id":"final_016","text":"As shown in Figure 4, GRU reaches over 75% validation accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s20","report_id":"final_016","text":"On IMDB, GRU obtains a validation accuracy of 85.3% (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s21","report_id":"final_016","text":"SVM reaches 54.7% accuracy on CIFAR-10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"final_016_s22","report_id":"final_016","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}